      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Affirmation",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>Affirming that what is in it [? the document] is valid. </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Chief Rabbi Ba\u0304rka\u0304r, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>on 23 [Raja]b of the year 1244 [28 January 1829] </p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
